SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus (disappearance only)
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 19:33:38 +07\, seen from Phnom Penh\, KH.\n
 The Moon sets during the occultation: only the disappearance is above the 
 horizon.\nThe Moon is 7° up in the WSW · dark sky.\nTimes for the Moon's
  mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: https:
 //occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=11.5625&lon=104.9160
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=11.5625&lon=104.9160
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
